{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NHYbuu-8F-JHgerA-c4H1A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.630048+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NHYbuu-8F-JHgerA-c4H1A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/DdZrfDOhHgfV0p5j7OpOTYqTKafTooWTfRlsFGNnyFBu5ymib1vyNUicugPggmF2AKBibzgnRhjHvfFWx7MjCMsAyeJ8ZxiaCeCvVgLJaJfR3h4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>四川省社会科学院</span><span><br/></span><span>2027年接收推免生章程</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/1r7YVBgoy9JqVfRV4ce5orSFibcuHlPHWQgdzFqOpIPtZTe5mSwwL4VfDicIP4ibqVRHxzOiaibZPxE70z189OIUvheiaOVbZNd16BoZoCqa3ReD0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span> 为做好我院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，根据教育部有关推免生工作文件精神，结合我院实际，制定本章程。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，在校期间未受过纪律处分。</span></p><p><span>2.具有创新精神、创新能力以及科研潜力，身体健康，学习成绩优秀。</span></p><p><span>3.获得本科学校的推免生资格，并在“全国推免服务系统”中备案。</span><span><span> </span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收名额</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院各专业接收推免生的名额以“全国推免服务系统”备案信息为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.《申请免试攻读四川省社会科学院硕士学位研究生申请表》（网址：</span><span><br/></span><span>http://www.sass.cn/912019/81988.aspx下载）一份。</span></p><p><span>2.两名副高级职称以上专家的推荐信。</span></p><p><span>3.本科学习成绩单一份、推荐免试资格证明信，要求加盖所在学校教务处公章。</span></p><p><span>4.各类获奖证书及英语等级证书复印件一份，以及其它体现申请人学术专长和创新能力的代表性论文、出版物等科研成果复印件或证明。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人须在规定时间内登陆“全国推免服务系统”（网址：yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）报名并提交上述材料，材料请邮寄至四川省社会科学院招就办（“全国推免服务系统”的开通时间以教育部通知为准）。</span></p><p><span>2.申请人所提交的材料经我院招就办及本专业导师组审核后，将通过“推免服务系统”通知符合条件的申请人参加我院复试。</span></p><p><span>3.复试安排另行通知，复试内容包括专业课面试和英语面试，复试成绩总分为120分，其中专业课面试100分，英语面试20分。复试成绩合格者（专业面试成绩不得低于60分，英语面试成绩不得低于12分），方可录取。</span></p><p><span>4.申请人收到我院发送的拟录取通知后，须在24小时内登录“全国推免服务系统”进行确认，否则视为放弃我院拟录取资格。</span></p><p><span>5.推免生的拟录取名单将在我院网站（http://www.sass.cn）上公示不少于7日。</span></p><p><span>6.进入公示名单的拟录取考生须在我院官网下载打印思想政治情况调查表、体检表，到档案所在部门出具证明，按体检要求到二级甲等及以上医院进行体检并出具体检报告。将思想政治情况调查表和体检表扫描发送至我院招就办邮箱（yjs89101@126.com）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格复审</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>凡有以下情形之一者，将取消其入学资格：</span></p><p><span>1.自取得拟录取资格起至入学报到之日，存在违法违纪、受处分记录或学术不端行为的；</span></p><p><span>2.入学报到时未取得毕业证书和学位证书的；</span></p><p><span>3.身体健康状况不符合国家规定体检标准的；</span></p><p><span>4.思想政治素质和品德考核不合格的；</span></p><p><span>5.提交申请材料弄虚作假，或存在其他严重影响推免过程及结果公平公正行为的。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖励政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>凡被我院正式录取并报到注册后的推免生可享受一次性新生学业奖学金10000元。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本章程未尽事宜，以教育部当年的有关文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>地址：四川省成都市新都区斑竹园街道（四川省社会科学院斑竹园院区）招就办</span></p><p><span>电话：028—69360666</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>四川省社会科学院研究生学院</span></p><p><span>2026年9月12日</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>编辑：兰图 骆冰倩</span></p><p><span>责任编辑：钟鑫</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cca311a5366ac58d860e7f415a1c2202f9c94b59f0d40a6138423c9c40c6129b","textLength":1237,"sourceSha256":"92d3d0e4b82f41001f4604dc95c630fcf20d0881886b37083d4222d6d1e0adac","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-89a92cf63d7cc52129ee","title":"2026年四川省社会科学院2027年接收推免生章程","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.630048+00:00"}
